File name: DMM2LOOP.MP
Path description: Mithril Mines, but in reverse.
Path starts: Mithril Mine (level 6)
Path ends: ---
Area of the game: Module 4
Level recommendation: 45+
Type of path: Loop
File format: New
Monsters encountered: rotting monstrousity, winged demon, black pudding,
